  "description": "two-voice pitch shifter on the main output, recorded into the first free RAM slot (R1-R4); its own output comes back through the main output, so it spirals with the track level: PTCH and PTC2 +-24 semitones (64 = off for PTC2), ENTI pitch swoop on trig, FB feedback, WIN window 12..370 ms, SCAT random scatter of each head's jump, DLAY predelay, MODE HOLD stops recording (a pitched freeze)"
